  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat1/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Review 2026-11-01 on 100b6fbb6e: installed tree-sitter-rust 0.24.2 (floor from 1856bcf2fe, PR #1459). Fixture 'unsafe extern \"C\" { pub fn getpid(); pub fn write(..); pub safe fn abs(..); }' yields 3 function symbols with ffi_import abi C, and calls resolve to them. Corpus re-measure with the shipped grammar: unsafe-extern block lines starting a foreign_mod_item: pdfium-render 11056/11056, nextjs 3/3, wasmtime 80/82 (the 2 are inside a cfg_if! macro and a block scope, not the 2024-syntax failure). MECHANISM: outdated tree-sitter-rust 0.24.0 grammar did not parse Rust 2024 unsafe extern. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fomab. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 5896
